Source: historytracers
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Thiago Marques <historytracers@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), systemd
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/historytracers/historytracers

Package: historytracers
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, historytracers-www (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Teaching is often a daily challenge for both students and teachers,
 each for different reasons.
 Our goal is to support both sides of the learning process by providing diverse tools.

Package: historytracers-www
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Web content for History Tracers
 Static web content served by the History Tracers viewer.
 Install this package alone (with historytracers-images) to serve
 the content with your own web server (Apache, IIS).

Package: historytracers-images
Architecture: all
Depends: historytracers-www (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Images for History Tracers
 Provides the image files used by the History Tracers viewer,
 excluding the img_options.json configuration file.

Package: historytracers-devel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for History Tracers
 Source code and development files for the History Tracers
 teaching tool.  Contains the complete repository source tree
 excluding the pre-built www/ directory.
